    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Pronouns in the sentence",
     "texto": [
      "Personal pronouns change form according to case: **widzę go** («I see him»), **daj mi** («give me»), **znam ją** («I know her»).",
      "The short forms **mi, ci, go, ją** usually go next to the verb and do not carry the main stress."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
